1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,470
If the zombie apocalypse starts on a cruise ship, and something's moving in the lifeboat...

2
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:09,540
Rule one. Don't open anything until you know what's inside.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:13,270
So you knock. And something knocks back.

4
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:20,030
It's not a zombie. It's Marco, a deckhand. He's been hiding in there all night.

5
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:23,310
Rule two. Never lower a lifeboat alone.

6
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:27,130
One person works the winch. Someone has to ride it down.

7
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:29,160
And it's a long way down.

8
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,220
Rule three. Learn the ship.

9
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:37,130
Marco knows the crew corridors. Passages the passengers never see.

10
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:39,050
That's how you get around them.

11
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:43,700
You try the radio. Static. Nobody's answering.

12
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,670
Then the ship's horn sounds.

13
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,790
Nobody on the bridge touched it.

14
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,570
Someone else is up there.
